From d1899ce7953bf9bc860f29d9d793a2fcb257879b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 17:27:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 580/638] aros: crash keys over the system CrashReporter
 annotation block

Replace the crash key stubs on AROS with an implementation of the
Breakpad-style CrashKeyString interface over a CrashAnnotationBlock
(base/aros/crash_annotations) registered with exec under
CrashReporter.annotations. The system CrashReporter copies the block
into the report when any task of the process traps, so url-chunk,
top-origin, the switches, GPU keys and the rest appear in its
[Annotations] section. chrome_main_delegate sets the Product: header
and the ptype/pid keys.
